## Configuration Changes Made

### Xcode Project Settings
```xml
// Debug Configuration
COMPILATION_CACHE_ENABLE_CACHING = YES
OTHER_SWIFT_FLAGS = "-Xfrontend -warn-long-function-bodies=200 -Xfrontend -warn-long-expression-type-checking=200"

// Release Configuration  
SWIFT_COMPILATION_MODE = wholemodule
COMPILATION_CACHE_ENABLE_CACHING = YES
```

### Code Changes
- AuthManager.swift: Conditional Google Sign-In for macOS compatibility
- Build settings: Added compilation cache and diagnostic flags

